# Wave T32 (Ashfall kit): timberroof — Ashfall's own roof kind.
# WEATHERED-TIMBER PLANK ROOF: long horizontal grey-timber boards
# (four planks per tile, end seams staggered, nail dots at the
# seams) with pale ash settled in the board grooves. A plank roof
# is structurally unlike every shipped roof: Lilac's/Fernmere's/
# Mistford's shingle courses, Copperton's/Farsight's slabs,
# Wildflower's rose lattice, Fairhaven's stitched canvas,
# Eldergrove's banded thatch. Worn by the Contest Hall, Ando's
# House and the town's two facade cottages — the painting's
# ash-grey timber register. (NO-SAME-KIT law;
# WAVE-T32-ASHFALL-PLAN.md.)
PIX tile-timberroof 16 16
